<title>HONG KONG: Swire sets price for new Island Plc units.</title>
<headline>Swire sets price for new Island Plc units.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Properties Ltd said the average price for an additional 64 units on offer at its Island Place development was HK$6,362 per sq ft.</p>
<p>The average price of the original 48 residential units on offer in its Island Place pre-sale was HK$6,282 per sq ft.</p>
<p>Swire said on Thursday that the 48 original flats on offer were 14 times oversubscribed with 721 applications received since registration opened on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Registration for the units closes on Friday and flat selection is due to begin on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
